---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Developer & Builder passionate about creating impactful software"
	pubDate={new Date('February 28 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm <strong>Amr</strong> — a developer and builder passionate about creating 
		impactful software. This notebook is my digital garden where I document my learning 
		journey, share insights, and explore ideas in technology and development.
	</p>

	<p>
		I believe in continuous learning and the power of writing as a tool for understanding. 
		Here you'll find articles about web development, programming concepts, and my experiences 
		building things. My goal is to create content that's both helpful to others and a reference 
		for my future self.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I'm not coding or writing, I'm probably exploring new technologies, contributing to 
		open source, or finding ways to improve my workflow. I enjoy solving complex problems and 
		turning ideas into reality through code.
	</p>

	<p>
		Feel free to connect with me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amrtariq/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a> 
		— I'm always happy to discuss technology, collaborate on projects, or just chat about 
		development. Thanks for visiting!
	</p>
</Layout>
